*> vybe-test: cobol/string_delimited_forms/unstring_space_delimiter
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_string_delimited_forms.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SRC PIC X(15) VALUE "HELLO WORLD".
01 W1 PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
01 W2 PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    UNSTRING SRC DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO W1 W2.
    DISPLAY W1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING W1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO   "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO   ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY W2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING W2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "WORLD   "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [WORLD   ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

